#: lib/tymeslot_web/live/dashboard/availability/time_off_card.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "1 booking sits inside this time off. It stays in your diary until you move or cancel it."
msgid_plural "%{count} bookings sit inside this time off. They stay in your diary until you move or cancel them."
msgstr[0] "1 prenotazione ricade in questa assenza. Resta nella tua agenda finché non la sposti o la annulli."
